1 0 0 1 54 288 Tm (BoundedAudioQueue implements a deliberate real-time policy: when the queue is full, drop the) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 273 Tm (oldest chunk instead of blocking the producer.) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 258 Tm () Tj
