1 0 0 1 54 408 Tm (15. Threading Model) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 393 Tm (The current runtime has a simple but important threading model:) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 378 Tm () Tj
1 0 0 1 54 363 Tm (main thread: consumer loop + periodic logging) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 348 Tm () Tj
1 0 0 1 54 333 Tm (producer thread: iterates source chunks and fills bounded queue) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 318 Tm () Tj
1 0 0 1 54 303 Tm (optional source callback thread: inside sounddevice when microphone mode is active) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 288 Tm () Tj
1 0 0 1 54 273 Tm (In microphone mode this means there can effectively be three layers of execution:) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 258 Tm () Tj
1 0 0 1 54 243 Tm (sounddevice callback receives frames) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 228 Tm () Tj
1 0 0 1 54 213 Tm (microphone adapter iterator yields chunks) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 198 Tm () Tj
1 0 0 1 54 183 Tm (runtime producer thread forwards them into the bounded queue) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 168 Tm () Tj
1 0 0 1 54 153 Tm (main-thread consumer processes them) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 138 Tm () Tj
1 0 0 1 54 123 Tm (16. Shutdown Behavior) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 108 Tm (Shutdown is coordinated through events and queue closing.) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 93 Tm () Tj
1 0 0 1 54 78 Tm (AudioIngestionRuntime.stop\(\) sets a stop event) Tj
