1 0 0 1 54 618 Tm (20. Best Way to Understand the Code in Practice) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 603 Tm () Tj
1 0 0 1 54 588 Tm (Run simulated mode first.) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 573 Tm () Tj
1 0 0 1 54 558 Tm (Read main.py top to bottom.) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 543 Tm () Tj
1 0 0 1 54 528 Tm (Read runtime.py next.) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 513 Tm () Tj
1 0 0 1 54 498 Tm (Then read simulated.py .) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 483 Tm () Tj
1 0 0 1 54 468 Tm (Only after that read microphone.py .) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 453 Tm () Tj
1 0 0 1 54 438 Tm (That order works because simulated mode is the simplest executable path. If you start with) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 423 Tm (the microphone adapter, you end up learning callback plumbing before you understand the) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 408 Tm (system around it.) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 393 Tm () Tj
1 0 0 1 54 378 Tm (21. Final Takeaway) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 363 Tm (The current code is a well-structured real-time ingestion skeleton:) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 348 Tm () Tj
