1 0 0 1 54 318 Tm () Tj
1 0 0 1 54 303 Tm (an adapter yields AudioChunk objects) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 288 Tm () Tj
1 0 0 1 54 273 Tm (the runtime protects itself with a bounded queue) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 258 Tm () Tj
1 0 0 1 54 243 Tm (processing currently means diagnostics, not alignment) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 228 Tm () Tj
1 0 0 1 54 213 Tm (metrics and logging show whether the ingestion path behaves correctly) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 198 Tm () Tj
